#### Template 1: Feature File Structure

**Purpose:** Standard Gherkin file format produced by `/eap-spec-fr-create`
**Location:** `docs/requirements/functional/<concern>/<capability>.feature`

```gherkin
@FR-{CONCERN}-{FILE}-010
Feature: {Capability Name}
  As a {role}
  I need {capability}
  So that {business value}

  Rule: {Business rule grouping}

    @FR-{CONCERN}-{FILE}-010
    Scenario: {Happy path description}
      Given {precondition with concrete values}
      When {action}
      Then {observable outcome}

    @FR-{CONCERN}-{FILE}-020
    Scenario: {Error path description}
      Given {precondition}
      When {invalid action}
      Then {error handling}
```
